~ start
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(3072.0, 300.0), 0.75, 2, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: Hey Fenn, you almost here?
Fenn: Maybe? I dunno.
Az: [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i]. I'm curious,[wait=0.3] how do you do the thing with the leaves?
Fenn: Uh... I don't really know. I've always been able to do it.
Az: Well,[wait=0.3] you're pretty good at it. You- [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i] you should be proud.
Fenn worry: Thanks,[wait=0.3] I guess.
Az: What's wrong?
Fenn: I dunno. It's weird. It can't really do much. It's just leaves.
Az:  Hm.
Fenn: Now I have a question.
Az: Shoot.
Fenn: Is your name Az because you have asthma?
Az laugh: HAH! [i]No[/i]. The amount of times I've heard that one...
Az: My full name is Zara, but I've been Az since I was a kid. [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i]. 
Az annoy: Got my diagnosis much later. Like the world was playing a joke.
Az: Anyway, I'll stop bothering you. 
Az: Get back here so we can deal with the ice.
Fenn: Okay!
Wizard awkward: [font_size=35]My... my nameth is Winston.[/font_size]
Az: Dude,[wait=0.3] no one cares.
Winston hood grit: [font_size=60]GEEZ! I'm [shake level=7 rate=30][i]sorry[/i][/shake]. [wave freq=7 amp=20]I thoughteth we were sharing.[/wave][/font_size]
Fenn: I care!! 
Fenn starry: It's good to meetheth you, Winston.
Winston hood awkward: [font_size=35]G-[wait=0.3] Good to meeteth thee too.[/font_size]
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("11-Az-FiresideChat-1-HeaterArea", true)
=> END